msgstr ""

#: ../../source/mp/l2_storage/nixl_native.rst:17
msgid ""
"``POSIX`` advertising ``FILE_SEG`` and ``OBJ`` advertising ``OBJ_SEG`` "
"are the reference configurations below. Another plugin can be substituted"
" only when it supports ``DRAM_SEG`` and exactly one of those storage "
"segments. The connector checks those capabilities when it starts and "
"rejects ambiguous plugins."
msgstr ""

